{'symbol': 'SJM', 'date': '2023-03-08 08:00:00', 'title': 'THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BOFA SECURITIES 2023 CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE', 'text': 'ORRVILLE, OHIO , MARCH 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE J.M. SMUCKER CO. (NYSE: SJM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MARK SMUCKER, CHAIR OF THE BOARD, PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, AND TUCKER MARSHALL, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT AT THE BOFA SECURITIES 2023 CONSUMER AND RETAIL CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MARCH 14, 2023, AT 8:00 A.M.'}